{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_016ky74XFfw8DoERYpjxozUZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All ten SOS cards are implemented, tested, and committed. The full workspace suite passes — **1252 tests** (1145 engine regression + FDN reference + ~62 new SOS tests), the working tree is clean, and every TODO item is checked off (13/13) with one commit per item.\n\n**What was built**\n\n*Shared engine seams (E1–E3):* `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` now fires from both cast paths (a free cast is still a cast per rule 601.2); `BeginningOfPrecombatMainTriggeredEvent` fires from `advance_phase` after mana pools empty; `get_cost_reduction` aggregates `spell_cost_reduction` from the caster's battlefield permanents for instants/sorceries.\n\n*The ten cards*, each in its own `card_impl.py` with 5–11 real-engine tests:\n- **sos_4 Together as One** — Converge via `colors_spent`\n- **sos_1 The Dawning Archaic** — graveyard cost reduction, attack-trigger free cast, exile-instead replacement\n- **sos_245 Witherbloom** — affinity for creatures, self + granted via E3\n- **sos_226 Silverquill** — Casualty 1 (one `choose_card`, copy via `copy_spell`)\n- **sos_257 Great Hall** — restricted mana, in-place 2/4 Wizard animation, per-spell pump\n- **sos_57 Mana Sculpt** — Refute-style counter + delayed one-shot mana via E2\n- **sos_120 Improvisation Capstone** — exile-until-MV-4, free casts, recurring Paradigm copy\n- **sos_13 Emeritus // Swords** — Inkling token, prepared (rulebook 722.3c: copy in exile, cast *paying* {W})\n- **sos_201 Lorehold** — miracle {2} grant via draw event, opponent-upkeep loot\n- **sos_97 Ral Zarek** — surveil, multi-player discard, reanimate, seeded coin flips + skip-turns\n\n**Additive engine edits beyond E1–E3** (all justified by a real card need, engine tests green throughout): `AttacksTriggeredEvent` is now actually fired (it existed but nothing fired it); a stack→graveyard replacement path for \"exile instead\" effects; restricted mana in `ManaPool` with a `spell=` kwarg on `can_pay`/`pay`; `card.mana_spent` stamping; per-turn reset of `cards_drawn_this_turn`; `GameState.rng`; `Player.skip_turns` consumed in the turn-wrap logic.\n\n**Notable spec-over-plan deviations** (logged in `KEY_DECISIONS.md`, noted inline in `TODO.md`): the prepared copy is cast paying {W} per rule 722.3c rather than free; self-ETB triggers register from `on_resolve` because `move_to_zone` fires the entry event before registering the entering card's triggers (a latent issue FDN ETB cards share); and loyalty activations don't set `chosen_targets` anywhere in the engine, so the planeswalker reads caller-set targets with sensible fallbacks. Each card was also verified with throwaway smoke checks beyond its own test file (e.g. casualty on free-cast spells, miracle off a loot draw mid-opponent-turn, reduced-cost spend feeding Mana Sculpt)."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":502,"cache_read_input_tokens":307502,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":502},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"75cf876e-0070-4da1-a9bb-823668fe208a","uuid":"27d858d2-3fc7-4435-9fc6-297f03e49253","request_id":"req_011CbuDQD7VTv8gqWHNiVfP4"}
